Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars and reach for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the sky I believe in tomorrow if we try!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.34,0:00:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.22,0:00:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.92,0:00:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.56,0:00:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.86,0:00:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.32,0:00:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, baby, baby, oh,\Nwe share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to see for you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.78,0:00:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the darkness\Nthat is in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So hard to see, but to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In where we need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.54,0:00:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you and me, it's true that we.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the rush brought on by this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Through head to feet, I feel the beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting me to walk on, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times, take my hand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.98,0:00:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.32,0:01:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.56,0:01:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.04,0:01:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on let's go everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.94,0:01:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh as we chase we're being chased.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.90,0:01:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,From the top we go on straight and wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way. I've got to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.80,0:01:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I want to share your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.48,0:01:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here it starts, so don't lose heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bound to lose to this flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,From boot to hood, I feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be free to be, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.94,0:01:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, even if I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.98,0:01:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, I know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times,\Nshare the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.54,0:01:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.78,0:01:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.46,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:01:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.84,0:02:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you are there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.48,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.56,0:02:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon it will be you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.80,0:02:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.58,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.98,0:02:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.10,0:02:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.94,0:02:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.30,0:02:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd heard rumors you were\Nsomewhere on the archipelago,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.42,0:02:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but I chalked them up as ghost stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.78,0:02:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet here you are, sticking your\Nneck out for these rookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.10,0:02:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You just can't shake those\Ninstincts, can you, Rayleigh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.70,0:02:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Once a pirate, always a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be more than happy to retire in\Npeace and live out the quiet life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.72,0:02:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's a little tough to do when the\NNavy keeps hanging wanted posters of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.34,0:02:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You were a member of the\NRoger Pirates, Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.84,0:03:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think your\Ncrimes can be forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.48,0:03:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we were to make an\Nhonest attempt at capturing you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,that would require some serious\Npreparation on our part.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm so relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.72,0:03:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That old man has really got some power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our attacks went through\Nhim as if he were a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.56,0:03:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But when Rayleigh attacked, it hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just look the\Nother way and let these kids go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.40,0:03:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the harm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.88,0:03:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.79,0:03:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What reality are you living in?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.20,0:03:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.11,0:03:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way I can just\Nlet them off the hook
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.82,0:03:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Not when we have to answer\Nto the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe HQ's got to keep\Nthem happy and that won't
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.04,0:03:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,do it I'd appreciate it\Nif you don't interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.62,0:03:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, start running\Nand look after yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.28,0:03:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't win this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.70,0:03:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're too weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.68,0:03:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.58,0:04:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows when he's beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.50,0:04:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, ain't that a pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.96,0:04:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not before I let loose one final attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.94,0:04:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,With all of my cola energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.66,0:04:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd that feel, you mechanical ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.46,0:04:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hurry, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.78,0:04:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man, thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.58,0:04:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.49,0:04:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Best of luck to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.48,0:04:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sacred Yata Mirrors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.26,0:04:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.76,0:04:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he's trying to help us see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.76,0:04:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're staying put.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels good to hold a blade again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.84,0:04:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Amano Murakumo, soy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.20,0:05:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was expecting a laid-back,\Nhassle-free island excursion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.80,0:05:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is nothing but a\Nseries of surprises, Kizaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.74,0:05:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That light from before! It's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.12,0:05:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess the old man saved us again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.62,0:05:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears he's the Dark King, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anyone put\NUncle through a fight like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.42,0:05:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We were so close to closing the\Nbook on Roro Noah's days of crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.52,0:05:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,PX1!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.43,0:05:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish Roro Noah off first!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.40,0:05:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's barely alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.38,0:05:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.94,0:05:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Franky, do me a favor\Nand keep Nami safe, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.74,0:05:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep on running. We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You take care of yourself, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.82,0:05:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to help Moose up and Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.68,0:05:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Put me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.74,0:06:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.26,0:06:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.72,0:06:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.24,0:06:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, you're even more\Nweak and useless than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting out of here together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.66,0:06:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Those were Luffy's orders,\Nand I'm sticking to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.82,0:06:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.73,0:06:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, do I hear...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.24,0:06:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You go on without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.88,0:06:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. I'll hold him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.06,0:06:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't do it, Brooke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.64,0:06:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know how strong he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll rip you apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.24,0:06:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Never fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.64,0:06:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Run on, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.10,0:06:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what must be done!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.80,0:06:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There comes a time when a man\Nmust put everything on the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.50,0:06:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No bones about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That was pretty pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.08,0:06:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Brooke, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.24,0:06:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:06:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.32,0:07:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the hell away from\Nthem, you stupid cyborg!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.14,0:07:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, my leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.44,0:07:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Move, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna shoot you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.62,0:07:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Moron, why aren't you running?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.64,0:07:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you distract me, my subordinates\Nare quite capable on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.70,0:07:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I dropped you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.60,0:07:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It was an accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're in trouble over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.32,0:07:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got plenty of trouble yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.32,0:08:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But just to be fair, I won't use\Nmy battle-axe on you this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.42,0:08:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a push-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.98,0:08:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.76,0:08:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How can his attacks work on him\Nwhen Luffy's made of proper?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.00,0:08:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, we have to keep moving! Sachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.92,0:08:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.78,0:08:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody's gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.26,0:08:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Gecko, it's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the hell away from my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.08,0:08:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, rumble ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.80,0:09:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.44,0:09:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I like Little Chopper better!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly am I looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.30,0:09:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's even worse than\Nwhat the others told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.94,0:09:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an interesting\Npower you've got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.70,0:09:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too bad you don't seem\Nto have any control over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.80,0:09:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what it's come to. Even\Nif he beats him, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.02,0:09:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on. But\Nhe seems confused. Now's our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.36,0:10:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji. Brooke. Get up. Snap out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.24,0:10:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper bought us some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.70,0:10:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.30,0:10:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We wanna live, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.14,0:10:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're blowing our\Nchance. Brooke. Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand down, PX1.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.26,0:10:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is officially too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.96,0:10:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.60,0:10:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just how many of these guys are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.02,0:10:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.08,0:10:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.99,0:10:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the real Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.46,0:11:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.70,0:11:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You are more Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.86,0:11:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.84,0:11:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your mercy to thank for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.70,0:11:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time to talk\Nto the enemy. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.12,0:11:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If you could take a vacation,\Nwhere is it you'd like to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.16,0:11:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.56,0:11:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get out\Nof here while we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,S-S-Solo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.77,0:12:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.06,0:12:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You bring him back here, you monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.18,0:12:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.92,0:12:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.88,0:12:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.94,0:12:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.24,0:12:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.54,0:12:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.54,0:12:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost control?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.62,0:12:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, where the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.96,0:13:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This beast has gone mad, but\Nthat's not what worries me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.62,0:13:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to know what he's doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.84,0:13:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Bartholomew Kuma,\Ncan't trust pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.20,0:13:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The Seven Warlords are\Nsupposed to be at Navy HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.44,0:13:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.35,0:13:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could help, but\Nthere's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.24,0:13:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like Saru was erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.48,0:13:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna guess that means\Nthis guy's the real Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.72,0:13:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.14,0:13:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That power he used, I've seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.20,0:13:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Back on Thriller Bark, he\Nerased a girl like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.60,0:13:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just made her disappear, and\Nthat was the last I saw of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope he's still alive
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.36,0:14:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell did\Nthat guy do to Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.28,0:14:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.84,0:14:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm gonna answer you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.24,0:14:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget I'm the\Nworld's most guarded man?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.10,0:14:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But someone might tell\Nyou he can send you flying
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.80,0:14:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,for three days and nights\Nwith those paw pads.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't say if it's true or\Nnot, but that's the rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.64,0:14:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Kuma knows where they go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.64,0:14:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's no way you're going to\Nfind your friend on these islands?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.24,0:14:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Or anywhere else around\Nhere, for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.50,0:14:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll probably land on the\Nother side of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.94,0:14:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.44,0:14:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.10,0:14:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us what you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.56,0:14:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us where you sent Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.26,0:14:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's the real deal, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.32,0:14:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The first three were bad enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.24,0:14:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And now he shows up to finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.56,0:14:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of power is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.36,0:15:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got 8,000 men under my command!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.86,0:15:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me unleash them on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.54,0:15:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, he's behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.92,0:15:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.94,0:15:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.28,0:15:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.20,0:15:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He erased him? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.96,0:15:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That was Pucci he just hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.54,0:15:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your problem, you fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.06,0:15:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That was your ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.32,0:15:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just run!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.36,0:15:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Move, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.40,0:15:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Move me, huh? Just go! Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We can figure out a plan once we're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.76,0:15:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.64,0:16:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.32,0:16:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But Zoro...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.64,0:16:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain just said we can\Nfigure it out after we're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.74,0:16:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.62,0:16:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That last beam just grazed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.26,0:16:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can help you walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.98,0:16:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.18,0:16:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cover you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.30,0:16:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Brooke!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.50,0:16:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.06,0:16:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.94,0:16:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it costs me my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.64,0:16:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I'm already dead, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.34,0:16:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Brooke, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.16,0:16:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell can I let this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.44,0:16:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastards are racing all my\Nfriends right in front of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.36,0:16:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.94,0:16:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:16:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Start running, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.14,0:17:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.28,0:17:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going without you, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Just run! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.98,0:17:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody does that to my Gourmet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.44,0:17:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.16,0:17:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.40,0:17:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.02,0:17:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.90,0:17:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop where you are! Get back! Blamestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.06,0:17:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,One more! Blamestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.96,0:17:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.14,0:17:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.96,0:17:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Moose up, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.92,0:17:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.22,0:18:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.46,0:18:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Soji
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.68,0:18:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.54,0:18:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.82,0:18:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.94,0:18:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He got Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.66,0:18:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.18,0:18:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.26,0:18:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.54,0:18:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's starting to sound like they\Ncould really use my help over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.68,0:18:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only so much an old man can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.32,0:18:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm not quite the\Nfighter I used to be. So fending
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.10,0:18:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,off a Navy Admiral isn't\Nenough to make you satisfied,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.30,0:18:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.21,0:18:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you keep those\Nthoughts to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.10,0:18:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're already making\Nme look bad, you know
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.00,0:19:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark King Rayleigh, correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.74,0:19:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.40,0:19:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.18,0:19:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.02,0:19:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're asking me to trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.32,0:19:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's entirely your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.62,0:19:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm putting my own\Nneck on the line, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.18,0:19:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I deserve an\Nexplanation here. Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.68,0:19:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This matter is of no\Nconsequence to the government,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,so I have no obligation to\Ncooperate with the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.36,0:19:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And you deserve nothing of the sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.78,0:19:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.30,0:19:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, second gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.54,0:20:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.44,0:20:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.80,0:20:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.08,0:20:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.66,0:20:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Jack, can't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.46,0:20:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.44,0:20:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.68,0:20:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.10,0:21:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.74,0:21:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.28,0:21:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.52,0:21:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.68,0:21:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.22,0:22:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.80,0:22:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.76,0:22:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.46,0:22:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.98,0:22:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't leave her alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.46,0:22:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.38,0:22:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.62,0:22:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.72,0:22:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The End.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.80,0:22:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.12,0:23:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't save any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.26,0:23:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.78,0:23:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're just gonna blast\Nhim off like the rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.10,0:23:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't pull this mess without\Nan explanation, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.12,0:23:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And boy, it had better be a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.52,0:23:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I will never meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.12,0:24:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Striad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.26,0:24:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Grove 12, the Sabaody Archipelago,\Ndeep in the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.98,0:24:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,On this day, the Straw Hat\NPirates, led by Captain Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.12,0:24:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, came face to\Nface with true despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.12,0:24:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And one by one, they were eliminated.
